 Upload VR<br>", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1942110/eebd6e054ab5d712e344b7ade71d0e5183474057/header.jpg?t=1787826161", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1942110/ad23676cffbc58ab17c453e802bd1dc25d035d10/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787826161", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1942110/ad23676cffbc58ab17c453e802bd1dc25d035d10/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787826161", "website": "https://bootstrapisland.com/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i5-9600 / AMD Ryzen 3600x<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 12 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia RTX 2070<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 25 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>VR Support:</strong> Quest 3,  Quest 2, Steam Frame, Quest 3S, PSVR2, Valve Index, Rift S, Rift. Other headsets are not officially supported, but may still work.</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-13600K / AMD Ryzen 7700x<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia RTX 3080<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 25 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>VR Support:</strong> Quest 3,  Quest 2, Steam Frame, Quest 3S, PSVR2, Valve Index, Rift S, Rift. Other headsets are not officially supported, but may still work.</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"}, "linux_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul